{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings","id":906402,"title":"Scion Conversion of other Settings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-03T07:36:09-07:00","id":906402,"title":"Scion Conversion of other Settings?","content":"So a while ago, I tried to convert Diablo into the Scion universe and despite it needing some heavy polishing, it was quite popular. Recently, I've been tempted to try converting Berserk into the setting, portraying <b>The Idea of Evil</b> as a greater Titan of Suffering.<br /> <br /> But after re-reading the companion book, I found out my idea for The Idea of Evil would have been heavily similar to Hundun, the Titan of Chaos. They would have both focused on converting mortals and Scions into servants, instead of creating new ones.<br /> <br /> Anyways, I'm asking for any ideas / suggestions on other possible universes, stories, or themes that might be appropriate for a Scion conversion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 06-03-2016, 10:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T21:41:10-07:00","id":907445,"title":"","content":"Im actually interested in seeing if I can houserule a Scion/Exalted mash up for 2e Scion. Mechanically Scion but playing with the purviews to hit some Exalted's themes and lore. I have been playing a lot of EX3 and I'm enjoying it to a point, but I think the system is a bit too structured to represent the level of epicness it does without breaking down. From what I have seen of Scion it abstracts things a bit more so the math hopefully won't start to fight you as much.<br /> <br /> As a side note we are going to try a straight up mortal game in EX3 which I think will be dangerous but more mechanically rewarding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5622,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","user":"SpruceStripedGoose","date":". 06-05-2016, 12:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-04T23:02:38-07:00","id":907469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings?p=907445#post907445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Im actually interested in seeing if I can houserule a Scion/Exalted mash up for 2e Scion. Mechanically Scion but playing with the purviews to hit some Exalted's themes and lore. I have been playing a lot of EX3 and I'm enjoying it to a point, but I think the system is a bit too structured to represent the level of epicness it does without breaking down. From what I have seen of Scion it abstracts things a bit more so the math hopefully won't start to fight you as much.<br /> <br /> As a side note we are going to try a straight up mortal game in EX3 which I think will be dangerous but more mechanically rewarding.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well as far as epicness goes, I think one thing people are discussing is how completely over powered Scions get half way through Demigod. Apparently followers become worthless because of how easily they die. I'm not sure how much stronger Exalted characters are by comparison, though. Never really looked into the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T10:29:26-07:00","id":907714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings?p=907469#post907469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well as far as epicness goes, I think one thing people are discussing is how completely over powered Scions get half way through Demigod. Apparently followers become worthless because of how easily they die. I'm not sure how much stronger Exalted characters are by comparison, though. Never really looked into the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's kinda like comparing apples and oranges because of differences in the systems but generally Solars in EX3 start more powerful than a starting Scion in 1e, wrecking mortals from the get go. Eventually though Scions start to pass Solars at that transition to Demi-God reaching higher levels of overpowered.<br /> <br /> Overall I think one of the goals of the new edition of scion is to smooth this balance out, but it's hard to say how that will work at this early stage. That said I am optimistic and look foward to applying it's soloutions to other settings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5622-sprucestripedgoose","name":"SpruceStripedGoose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T10:52:01-07:00","id":907728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SpruceStripedGoose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings?p=907714#post907714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's kinda like comparing apples and oranges because of differences in the systems but generally Solars in EX3 start more powerful than a starting Scion in 1e, wrecking mortals from the get go. Eventually though Scions start to pass Solars at that transition to Demi-God reaching higher levels of overpowered.<br /> <br /> Overall I think one of the goals of the new edition of scion is to smooth this balance out, but it's hard to say how that will work at this early stage. That said I am optimistic and look foward to applying it's soloutions to other settings.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, well that kind of power increase is to be expected. I mean you're playing somebody on the road to godhood. You don't send mere canon fodder to take down a god. But still, the followers need to be at least worthy of a challenge. In Scion Hero, it says that a full squad of Mercenaries is dangerous even for Scions. If they added more followers of similar power level for each rank, it would help balance things out. Like, for example, you obtain a cult of vampires / therianthropes at Demigod level, or a retinue of minor deities at God level?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T12:03:41-07:00","id":907781,"title":"","content":"Perhaps the Behalit is an item that is attracted to scions and find their way into the hands of desperate individuals with a trace of divine blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T12:16:09-07:00","id":907785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings?p=907781#post907781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps the Behalit is an item that is attracted to scions and find their way into the hands of desperate individuals with a trace of divine blood.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well, the idea I used was that the Behelit was able to change mortals (Humans, and Scions of Hero / Demigod level) into Demons. It would also come with a small increase (about 2 dots) to Legend, which would make them even more tempting to use.<br /> <br /> <br /> The members of the God Hand would be proxy avatars for The Idea of Evil, and would thus be corrupted Scions who rose to godhood.<br /> <br /> But, like I said, Hundun works on a similar level. It doesn't create its own minions, it corrupts people into working for it, so I wasn't sure if that was redundant or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 06-05-2016, 03:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T12:26:32-07:00","id":907790,"title":"","content":"Nah don't worry about Redundancies. In fact I recommend not even worrying about contradicting anything, you have a good basic idea. 1st ed was a mess so just pick and choose what you like. Take heart 2nd ed is coming and it sounds much more promising.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T20:29:12-07:00","id":908074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/906402-scion-conversion-of-other-settings?p=907790#post907790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah don't worry about Redundancies. In fact I recommend not even worrying about contradicting anything, you have a good basic idea. 1st ed was a mess so just pick and choose what you like. Take heart 2nd ed is coming and it sounds much more promising.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I see, thank you. Well, I went and posted up what I had so far on the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/908069-berserk-conversion-the-idea-of-evil\">Berserk Conversion.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}